  "readmeFile": "ReadmeNuget.md",
  "releaseNotes": "# New Features\n      - ExecuteSqlField, When running in Stand-alone mode, it now also executes the ExecuteSql of its internal List.\n\n      # Bug Fixes\n      - Corrected behavior that occurred when a Field’s DOM was regenerated while a script was running.\n\n      # Adjustments\n      - Optimized the loading screen.\n      - Scripts now support default arguments of native APIs.\n      - Added casting support in scripts.\n      - Added support for the null-coalescing (??) operator in scripts.\n      \n      # Breaking Changes\n      - Dialog-related processing has been adjusted. Some classes are now deprecated—please remove them from your existing code; everything will continue to function correctly without them.",
